m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"nzqx3NJ1Yf-1bugLNikSCg","review_id":"VfToAtq2Mw6VIQBhWfh2Eg","date":"2017-08-21T04:40:15","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9292735457420349,"text_excerpt":"I pass by this place every dang day and I am always so tempted because I know there are tons of goodies waiting inside. Their coffee is excellent (brewing up both hey cafe and perc!!), their baristas are friendly, and the prices are reasonable (except for the juices and fruit...those seem a lil too pricey for me) Their pastries and baked goods selection is stellar! Bagel bombs, cookies, muffins, scones, quiche, brioche buns and biscuits. On Saturday's they have cinnamon rolls but you have to get in later in the day to snag one since they start baking them after they open"},{"business_id":"nzqx3NJ1Yf-1bugLNikSCg","review_id":"ihpCoUAiQyV3ozJ_hWq4gA","date":"2015-09-17T17:40:58","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9237444996833801,"text_excerpt":"My FAVOURITE (I'm Australian there is a U in there) coffee shop in nola. There is a trend here that I'm struggling to adapt to - the fruity tasting espresso. It isn't as offensive at P&G. Let's blame my unrefined palate but I just want coffee that tastes like coffee.... and a good flat white o.0 but thats a story for another day! The milk for the lattes is always frothed to perfection. Creamy and yummy. They offer milk alternatives. The iced tea is great for a hot day. Today I tried a wellness shot as I have been battling the flu. The ginger, lemon and cayenne pepper shot definitely has some KICK. Pow I think it has blasted the flu outta me! I try and be good and resist the baked goods......"},{"business_id":"nzqx3NJ1Yf-1bugLNikSCg","review_id":"6r3bNEl85eYHLJdcVFaPeg","date":"2018-05-24T13:56:07","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9174447059631348,"text_excerpt":"Great coffee shop in New Orleans. They have coffee, juice and pastries. I had a latte and it was great. The pastries looked very tempting (maybe next time). The staff was friendly and the wait was short. I highly recommend stopping in for your morning brew."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"nzqx3NJ1Yf-1bugLNikSCg","photo_id":"ibeaiHXLBNMQT2_PjZsuSg","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/ibeaiHXLBNMQT2_PjZsuSg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9109928607940674},{"business_id":"nzqx3NJ1Yf-1bugLNikSCg","photo_id":"f3X3hY8RzGhpUUfIJNZa2Q","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/f3X3hY8RzGhpUUfIJNZa2Q.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8307459354400635},{"business_id":"nzqx3NJ1Yf-1bugLNikSCg","photo_id":"_0wvY3asiHBLKD08WhZzIA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/_0wvY3asiHBLKD08WhZzIA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8000040054321289},{"business_id":"nzqx3NJ1Yf-1bugLNikSCg","photo_id":"w0aYYpStCEt5tvEr8jr0-A","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/w0aYYpStCEt5tvEr8jr0-A.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7881320714950562}]},"notebook_case":null}
